      "archive_entry": "trainset_28spk_txt/p226_028.txt"
    },
    {
      "id": "p287_037",
      "original_text": "But, after a dip in sales, growth was recorded.\n",
      "raw_text_hex": "4275742c20616674657220612064697020696e2073616c65732c2067726f77746820776173207265636f726465642e0a",
      "raw_text_sha256": "80e4b3b196cdfabece19d75032f19bfd39ca208dc38a5c55824abc879b90c69a",
      "archive_entry": "trainset_28spk_txt/p287_037.txt"
    },
    {
      "id": "p287_054",
      "original_text": "In time, the First Minister will grow in stature.\n",
